          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba umnikelo womuntu ungumhlatshelo womnikelo wokuthula, nxa enikela ngenkomo, enduna ingabe ensikazi, kawunikele phambi kweNkosi ungelasici. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzakubeka isandla sakhe ekhanda lomnikelo wakhe, awuhlabe ngasemnyango wethente lokuhlangana; amadodana kaAroni angabapristi akhaphazele igazi ealtareni inxa zonke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzakuthatha kuwo umhlatshelo womnikelo wokuthula, umnikelo owenzelwe iNkosi ngomlilo, idanga lemibilini, lamahwahwa wonke asemibilinini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lezinso zombili lamahwahwa azo angasezinkalweni, lamahwahwa angaphezu kwesibindi ozakuwasusa lezinso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadodana kaAroni azakukutshisa ealtareni kanye lomnikelo wokutshiswa phezu kwenkuni ezisemlilweni; kungumnikelo owenziwe ngomlilo olephunga elimnandi eNkosini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
