          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba umnikelo wakhe ongumhlatshelo womnikelo wokuthula eNkosini ungowemihlambi, enduna ingabe ensikazi, kanikele ngawo ungelasici. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba enikela ngemvu, ibe ngumnikelo wakhe, kayinikele phambi kweNkosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeke isandla sakhe enhlokweni yomnikelo wakhe, awuhlabe ngaphambi kwethente lokuhlangana; amadodana kaAroni akhaphazele igazi lawo ealtareni inxa zonke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzakuthatha kuwo umhlatshelo womnikelo wokuthula, umnikelo owenzelwe iNkosi ngomlilo, amahwahwa awo, lomsila wonke ononileyo ewuquma eduze lomgogodla, ledanga lemibilini, lamahwahwa wonke asemibilinini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lezinso zombili lamahwahwa azo angasezinkalweni, lamahwahwa angaphezu kwesibindi ozakuwasusa lezinso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
